            {
              "description": "The purist's buffalo wing sandwich with no compromises. Crispy fried chicken breast tossed in authentic Frank's RedHot buffalo sauce, paired with a chunky, creamy blue cheese dressing made from Gorgonzola or Roquefort. Fresh celery-carrot slaw with blue cheese crumbles, a rich bacon jam, and crispy fried onion strings complete this sophisticated take on wings and dressing.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "Buffalo Sauce",
                  "description": "A classic buffalo wing sauce made by melting butter into Frank's RedHot with a touch of Worcestershire and garlic. Warm, tangy, and perfectly spicy."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Chunky Blue Cheese Dressing",
                  "description": "A creamy dressing with large chunks of Gorgonzola or Roquefort cheese stirred into a base of mayo and sour cream, balanced with lemon juice and Worcestershire for a sophisticated, tangy bite."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Buffalo Blue Cheese Slaw",
                  "description": "A crunchy slaw with shredded cabbage, carrots, celery, and red onions tossed with blue cheese crumbles and a buffalo-tinged dressing with celery seed."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Buffalo Bacon Jam",
                  "description": "A sweet, smoky, and spicy jam made by rendering bacon with onions and garlic, then simmering in Frank's RedHot and brown sugar. Spread on the bottom bun for a rich, savory base."
                }
              ],
