            {
              "description": "Sweet heat that hits all the right notes. Frank's RedHot mixed with brown sugar and butter creates a glaze that caramelizes on crispy fried chicken. Balanced by a fresh brown sugar-buffalo slaw with apple cider undertones, a rich bacon jam with brown sugar depth, and a smooth goat cheese spread. Crispy bacon, candied jalapeños, and toasted pecans add textural contrast to this sweet-spicy sensation.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "Brown Sugar Frank's Glaze",
                  "description": "A glossy glaze made by simmering Frank's RedHot with brown sugar, butter, and garlic. The sugar caramelizes slightly, creating a sweet-spicy coating with subtle molasses notes."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Brown Sugar Buffalo Slaw",
                  "description": "A crunchy slaw with shredded cabbage, carrots, and red onions tossed in a mayo-based dressing with Frank's RedHot, apple cider vinegar, and brown sugar for balance and depth."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Brown Sugar Buffalo Bacon Jam",
                  "description": "A rich jam combining bacon, onions, and garlic simmered with Frank's RedHot, brown sugar, and apple cider vinegar. The brown sugar adds molasses sweetness to complement the heat and smokiness."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Brown Sugar Buffalo Goat Cheese Spread",
                  "description": "A creamy spread of softened cream cheese and tangy goat cheese blended with Frank's RedHot, brown sugar, and garlic. The brown sugar adds subtle sweetness to the savory spread."
                }
              ],
