            {
              "description": "The trendy hot honey sandwich elevated with homemade flair. Crispy fried chicken breast is drizzled with warm, spicy homemade hot honey infused with butter and heat. A fresh citrus-forward slaw, a sweet-spicy honey-bacon jam, and a smooth goat cheese spread create layers of flavor. Finished with crispy bacon, pickled red onions, and fresh herbs for a balanced, sophisticated take on the viral sensation.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "Whipped Honey Butter",
                  "description": "A silky blend of softened butter whipped with honey and a pinch of salt. Spread on the warm bun for richness and subtle sweetness that pairs beautifully with the heat of hot honey."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Mike's Hot Honey Drizzle",
                  "description": "A store-bought or homemade spicy honey glaze drizzled generously over the fried chicken. The combination of heat and honey creates a sweet-spicy coating that's addictive."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Hot Honey Slaw",
                  "description": "A fresh slaw with shredded cabbage, carrots, and red onions tossed in a light mayo-based dressing with apple cider vinegar, honey, and a hint of hot sauce for balanced sweet heat."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Hot Honey Bacon Jam",
                  "description": "A sweet-spicy jam combining bacon, onions, and garlic simmered with honey and hot sauce. The honey caramelizes with the bacon fat for rich, jammy sweetness."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Hot Honey Goat Cheese Spread",
                  "description": "A creamy spread of softened cream cheese and tangy goat cheese blended with hot honey and a pinch of cayenne. Sweet, creamy, and with a gentle heat throughout."
                }
