            {
              "description": "The secret ingredient is soda. A full can of Dr Pepper gets reduced down with tomato sauce, brown sugar, smoked paprika, and liquid smoke into a thick, sticky, cherry-caramel BBQ glaze that coats crispy fried chicken. Topped with melty pepper jack, maple bacon bourbon jam, and fried onion rings, this is BBQ done different.",
