                  "name": "White BBQ Pickled Vegetables",
                  "steps": [
                    "In a small saucepan, combine apple cider vinegar, mustard seeds, sugar, and salt.",
                    "Bring to a boil, then remove from heat.",
                    "Add thinly sliced red onions and sliced jalapeños to a jar.",
                    "Pour the hot pickling liquid over the vegetables.",
                    "Let cool to room temperature, then refrigerate for at least 30 minutes before serving."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "White Sauce Cream Cheese Spread",
                  "steps": [
                    "In a small bowl, combine softened cream cheese with 1 tablespoon of the cooled Alabama white sauce.",
                    "Mix until smooth and well blended.",
                    "Spread on the bottom bun before assembling."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "Assembly",
                  "steps": [
                    "Butter both halves of the bun and toast on a griddle or skillet until golden, about 2 minutes.",
                    "Spread White Sauce Cream Cheese Spread on the bottom bun.",
                    "Drizzle Alabama White BBQ Sauce over the chicken.",
                    "Place the white sauce-coated chicken on top.",
                    "Pile on White BBQ Slaw.",
                    "Add White BBQ Pickled Vegetables and fresh tomato slices.",
                    "Place the top bun and serve immediately."
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "id": "recipe-10",
              "number": 10,
              "title": "Alabama White BBQ Sauce Chicken Sandwich",
              "slug": "alabama-white-bbq-sauce-chicken-sandwich",
              "chapterId": "chapter-2"
            },
            {
              "description": "Inspired by the iconic Burger King Rodeo sandwich, this creative combination balances sweet BBQ sauce with cool, creamy ranch dressing. Crispy onion rings add textural contrast, while sharp cheddar and crispy shallots elevate this indulgent sandwich with textural sophistication and gourmet fried chicken technique.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "BBQ Sauce",
                  "description": "A classic sweet and tangy BBQ sauce made with ketchup, brown sugar, apple cider vinegar, and warm spices. Balanced and crowd-pleasing."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Ranch Dressing",
                  "description": "A creamy, herbaceous dressing made from mayonnaise, buttermilk, sour cream, and fresh herbs. Cool and tangy, it provides an excellent contrast to the BBQ sauce."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Rodeo Slaw",
                  "description": "A crisp slaw dressed with a light ranch-BBQ hybrid dressing, providing both cool and warm flavors."
                },
                {
                  "name": "BBQ Ranch Cheese Spread",
                  "description": "A unique spread combining softened American cheese with both BBQ sauce and ranch seasoning for dual-flavor depth."
                }
              ],
              "ingredientGroups": [
