            {
              "description": "A reimagining of Korean BBQ in sandwich form, this dish features crispy fried chicken breast glazed with a sweet, savory, and slightly spicy gochujang-soy sauce. Grilled kimchi and caramelized onions add umami depth, while cool pickled cucumber and fresh scallions provide brightness. A silky gochujang cream cheese spread ties everything together with bold Korean flavors that build with each bite.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "Chicken & Batter",
                  "description": "A delicate batter infused with sesame, creating a crispy golden exterior that absorbs the rich Korean BBQ glaze beautifully."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Korean BBQ Glaze",
                  "description": "A glossy sauce combining gochujang, soy sauce, brown sugar, sesame oil, and garlic for a perfect balance of sweet, salty, spicy, and savory."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Grilled Kimchi",
                  "description": "Spicy fermented cabbage briefly heated in a skillet to warm through and concentrate its bold flavors."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Caramelized Onions",
                  "description": "Sweet, deeply browned onions cooked low and slow until jammy and rich."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Gochujang Cream Cheese Spread",
                  "description": "A creamy blend of cream cheese and gochujang paste for an authentic Korean flavor profile with heat."
                }
