                  "description": "Crispy fried shallot slices that add textural contrast and a sweet, savory crunch."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Pickled Daikon Radish",
                  "description": "Thinly sliced daikon radish pickled in rice vinegar and sugar for a bright, crunchy bite that cuts through richness."
                }
              ],
