          "title": "INDIAN",
          "recipeCount": 3,
          "recipes": [
            {
              "description": "A vibrant sandwich that brings the creamy comfort of Indian tikka masala to a crispy fried chicken sandwich. Boneless, skinless chicken breast fried in beef tallow is smothered in a smooth, aromatic tomato-based sauce enriched with cream and perfumed with warming spices like garam masala, turmeric, and coriander. Layered on a buttered and toasted brioche bun with a samosa-style spread of curry basmati rice, mashed peas, and mashed potato, tangy mint-cucumber lassi slaw, and a spiced tikka masala bacon jam. Topped with crispy fried onions, pickled red onions, and fresh cilantro for a perfect balance of rich sauce, crunchy textures, and herbaceous brightness.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "Tikka Masala Sauce",
                  "description": "A smooth, rich tomato-based sauce enriched with cream and built on a foundation of toasted cumin seeds, ginger, and garlic. Warm spices like garam masala, turmeric, and crushed fenugreek leaves add depth and aromatics, making this sauce aromatic, creamy, and perfectly balanced between savory and slightly sweet."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Mint Cucumber Lassi Slaw",
                  "description": "A cool, tangy slaw inspired by Indian lassi drinks. Shredded cabbage and carrots are tossed with fresh cucumber, mint, and cilantro, then bound in a yogurt dressing spiked with lime juice and cumin. It provides a refreshing, herbaceous counterpoint to the rich sauce."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Tikka Masala Bacon Jam",
                  "description": "Crispy bacon simmered with onions, garlic, and ginger, then sweetened with brown sugar and spiced with garam masala and cumin. The addition of tomato paste ties it to the sauce while maintaining the richness of bacon, creating a sweet-savory-spicy spread."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Samosa Cream Cheese Spread",
                  "description": "A creamy, spiced base that captures the essence of a samosa's filling. Softened cream cheese and goat cheese are mixed with mashed peas, mashed potato, and cooked curry basmati rice, then seasoned with garam masala, cumin, coriander, and bright cilantro. It's an excellent base layer that mimics the comfort of samosa filling."
                }
              ],
