            },
            {
              "description": "Inspired by the classic Italian Caprese salad, this sub smothers crispy fried chicken in a fresh tomato basil marinara, then piles on a balsamic-dressed Caprese slaw loaded with cherry tomatoes, roasted red peppers, pickled red onions, fresh basil, and diced mozzarella. A pepperoni cherry tomato jam and tomato basil Italian herb cream cheese spread anchor the bottom sub roll, making this one of the most tomato-forward, basil-packed subs in the book.",
              "aboutSections": [
