            {
              "description": "A sophisticated, Italian-inspired sandwich that balances sweet and tangy with creamy and savory elements. The thick, glossy balsamic reduction drapes across whipped goat cheese, roasted red peppers, and caramelized onions, while peppery arugula and fresh thyme add brightness and herbaceous complexity to this refined composition.",
              "aboutSections": [
