            },
            {
              "description": "The legendary Marry Me Chicken gets the sub treatment — crispy fried chicken cutlet smothered in the famous creamy sun-dried tomato Parmesan sauce that's so irresistible it supposedly inspires marriage proposals. A fresh Italian arugula slaw adds crunch and freshness, while a roasted garlic sun-dried tomato basil cream cheese spread on the sub roll ties the whole thing together with herby richness and a Parmesan finish.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "Chicken & Batter",
                  "description": "A perfectly golden fried chicken cutlet with a delicate crust seasoned with Italian herbs and garlic."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Marry Me Sauce",
                  "description": "A luxurious, creamy sauce made with butter, garlic, sun-dried tomatoes, chicken broth, heavy cream, and Parmesan cheese — the legendary sauce that's supposedly marriage-proposal worthy."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Italian Arugula Slaw",
                  "description": "A fresh, peppery slaw of baby arugula, shredded red cabbage, cherry tomatoes, feta cheese, and salami, dressed with a light red wine vinegar vinaigrette."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Pepperoni Cherry Tomato Jam",
