          "recipes": [
            {
              "description": "A bold chipotle lime chicken sandwich that brings the heat of Mexican street food to a fried chicken foundation. Crispy fried chicken breast is smothered in a creamy chipotle adobo sauce, then layered with a tangy chipotle lime coleslaw loaded with cilantro and red cabbage. A sweet and spicy pineapple jalapeño bacon jam brings tropical depth on the bottom bun alongside a roasted corn and jalapeño goat cheese spread. Finished with pickled red onions, jalapeños, cotija cheese, and creamy avocado.",
