            {
              "description": "A vibrant elote-inspired chicken sandwich that brings Mexican street food to life. Crispy fried chicken is smothered in a creamy corn-based sauce, layered with elote slaw, and topped with a chorizo goat cheese spread. Cotija cheese, fresh cilantro, and lime add authentic finishing touches.",
