                  "description": "A complex, aromatic paste of allspice, thyme, Scotch bonnet, ginger, soy sauce, and brown sugar that infuses the chicken with Caribbean depth."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Jerk Mayo",
                  "description": "A simplified spiced mayo combining prepared jerk paste with creamy mayo and bright lime."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Caribbean Mango Slaw",
                  "description": "A tropical slaw of shredded cabbage, fresh mango, pineapple, cilantro, and red onion dressed in lime oil and honey."
                },
