          "recipes": [
            {
              "description": "This refined French-style sandwich celebrates the sharp, sophisticated flavors of green peppercorns in every layer. Crispy fried chicken gets a luxurious brandy and cream sauce with crushed green peppercorns, then piled with sautéed leeks and melted gruyère. A tangy slaw, creamy peppercorn goat cheese spread, and a smoky bacon jam create a symphony of refined, elegant flavors.",
              "aboutSections": [
