            {
              "description": "Bright, elegant piccata vibes on fried chicken — a silky lemon butter cream sauce with fresh dill and parsley gets spooned over the chicken, with sautéed spinach and fresh mozzarella adding creamy, earthy depth. A sharp, herbaceous slaw with capers and lemon zest keeps it fresh and sophisticated.",
