            {
              "description": "All garlic, all the time — a whole head of sweet, mellow roasted garlic gets mashed into a silky cream sauce with Parmesan and thyme for that garlic-bread-meets-fried-chicken magic. Creamy mashed potatoes schmeared on the bun, a roasted garlic bacon jam, and crispy garlic chips create layer upon layer of garlic bliss.",
              "aboutSections": [
