                    "Whisk together 2 tbsp vinaigrette, 1 tbsp mayonnaise, 1 tsp fresh lemon juice, and a pinch of salt for the dressing.",
                    "In a bowl, toss 1/2 cup fresh arugula, 1/4 thinly sliced fresh pear, 2 tbsp shaved aged gruyère, 1 tbsp candied walnuts (roughly chopped), 1 tbsp crispy pancetta bits, and 1/2 tsp fresh thyme leaves.",
                    "Pour dressing over and toss gently to coat.",
                    "Refrigerate until ready to serve."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "Honey Pear Bacon Jam",
                  "steps": [
                    "Cook 4 slices diced thick-cut bacon in a skillet over medium heat until crispy, about 6-7 minutes.",
                    "Drain most fat, leaving about 1 tbsp.",
                    "Add 1 minced shallot, cook 2 minutes.",
                    "Add 1/4 diced fresh pear, cook 2-3 minutes until softened and caramelized.",
                    "Add 1/2 tsp Dijon mustard, 1 tsp raw honey, 1/2 tsp fresh thyme leaves, 1 tbsp brown sugar, 1 tbsp apple cider vinegar, and 2 tbsp water.",
                    "Simmer on low for 15-18 minutes until thick and jammy.",
                    "Let cool and roughly chop to spreadable consistency."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "Honey Dijon Goat Cheese Spread",
                  "steps": [
                    "Mix 1 tbsp softened cream cheese and 1 tbsp softened goat cheese until smooth.",
                    "Stir in 1/2 tsp Dijon mustard, 1/2 tsp raw honey, 1/4 tsp fresh thyme leaves (minced), and a pinch of salt.",
                    "Mix until evenly combined."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "Assembly",
                  "steps": [
                    "Butter the potato bun and toast in a skillet until golden on both sides.",
                    "Spread Honey Dijon Goat Cheese Spread on the bottom bun.",
                    "Add a layer of Honey Pear Bacon Jam on top of the spread.",
                    "Place the fried chicken on the bottom bun.",
                    "Top with 2 slices of aged gruyère, allowing it to melt from the heat.",
                    "Layer crispy pancetta over the cheese.",
                    "Drizzle Honey Maple Dijon Vinaigrette over everything.",
                    "Add fresh pear slices, candied walnuts, and fresh thyme.",
                    "Top with Pear Gruyère Arugula Slaw.",
                    "Place top bun and serve immediately."
                  ]
                }
