              "title": "Peach Bourbon Brown Butter Chicken Sandwich",
              "slug": "peach-bourbon-brown-butter-chicken-sandwich",
              "chapterId": "chapter-8"
            },
            {
              "description": "A tropical paradise on a bun — lush coconut cream meets bright lime zest and raw honey for a creamy island-style glaze over crispy fried chicken. Toasted macadamia nuts and coconut flakes pile on crunch, a mango arugula slaw keeps things fresh, and a lime curd goat cheese spread ties it all together.",
