              "title": "Eggs Benedict Chicken Sandwich",
              "slug": "eggs-benedict-chicken-sandwich",
              "chapterId": "chapter-9"
            },
            {
              "description": "Texas Roadhouse meets a charcuterie board — that famous sweet cinnamon honey butter gets drizzled over crispy fried chicken with warm baked Brie melting on top, caramelized apples, and apple jelly. An apple walnut slaw adds crunch and freshness, a caramelized apple bacon jam and a cinnamon honey butter Brie cream cheese spread load up the bottom bun. Onion rings pile on the comfort. Sweet, buttery, warm, and indulgent.",
