            },
            {
              "description": "An elegant New Orleans-inspired sandwich that brings together crispy fried chicken with the coastal sophistication of remoulade sauce and fried calamari. The creamy goat cheese spread is enriched with marinara sauce, creating a rich Italian-Cajun fusion. Crispy fried calamari rings and shallots sit atop the chicken, which is coated in a traditional Cajun remoulade with capers, cornichons, and spicy mustard. This is a bold, complex sandwich for adventurous palates.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "Chicken & Batter",
                  "description": "A seasoned fried chicken breast with Old Bay and seafood stock in the wet batter, giving it subtle briny undertones that complement the remoulade and calamari."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Cajun Remoulade Sauce",
                  "description": "A classic Creole remoulade made with mayonnaise, Creole mustard, lemon juice, capers, cornichons, garlic, and Cajun spices with a touch of hot sauce. Tangy, complex, and slightly spicy—the signature sauce on the chicken."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Marinara Cream Cheese Spread",
                  "description": "A creamy goat cheese and cream cheese spread enriched with marinara sauce, creating a savory, slightly sweet Italian base that contrasts beautifully with the Cajun elements."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Cajun Calamari Slaw",
                  "description": "A Cajun-spiced slaw of shredded red cabbage and carrots with fresh parsley, tossed in a seasoned mayo-based dressing with hot sauce for heat."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Cajun Bacon Jam",
                  "description": "A spicy bacon jam made from rendered bacon with caramelized onions, garlic, Cajun seasoning, brown sugar, and vinegar. The spices tie the whole sandwich together."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Fried Calamari",
                  "description": "Fresh or frozen calamari rings breaded and fried until golden and crispy, providing a tender seafood element."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Crispy Fried Shallots",
                  "description": "Thinly sliced shallots breaded and fried until golden and crispy, adding a sweet, oniony crunch."
                }
              ],
