              "id": "recipe-86",
              "number": 86,
              "title": "Remoulade Calamari Chicken Sandwich",
              "slug": "remoulade-calamari-chicken-sandwich",
              "chapterId": "chapter-11"
            },
            {
              "description": "A bold, savory breakfast-inspired sandwich that transforms a breakfast bagel concept into a loaded chicken creation. Crispy fried chicken topped with a creamy everything bagel sauce made from mayo, sour cream, and cream cheese blended with everything bagel seasoning sits atop a bed of lox-style pickled red onions, ham, crispy bacon, cheddar cheese, and a fried egg. The everything bagel slaw provides a crunchy base, while fried tomato and fresh dill add brightness to this indulgent, over-the-top sandwich.",
              "aboutSections": [
                {
                  "name": "Chicken & Batter",
                  "description": "A seasoned fried chicken breast with cream cheese in the wet batter for added tenderness and subtle richness that complements the bagel flavors."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Everything Bagel Sauce",
                  "description": "A creamy blend of mayonnaise, sour cream, and cream cheese infused with everything bagel seasoning. This is the primary sauce—rich, tangy, and full of savory sesame, poppy seed, and allium flavors."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Everything Bagel Slaw",
                  "description": "A crunchy slaw of shredded red cabbage, carrots, and red onions seasoned with everything bagel seasoning and fresh dill, creating a slaw that complements the bagel theme."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Everything Bagel Bacon Jam",
                  "description": "A savory bacon jam made with thick-cut bacon, onions, garlic, everything bagel seasoning, and brown sugar. The bagel seasoning ties it directly into the sandwich's theme."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Scallion Cream Cheese Goat Cheese Spread",
                  "description": "A fresh, herbaceous spread combining cream cheese, goat cheese, and sour cream with fresh scallions, dill, and lemon zest. The everything bagel seasoning provides the finishing touch."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Lox-Style Pickled Red Onions",
                  "description": "Sweet, tangy, and brined with dill and coriander seeds, creating a cured-salmon-adjacent flavor profile without the fish."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Fried Tomato",
                  "description": "A fried tomato slice for textural contrast and brightness."
                },
                {
                  "name": "Fried Egg",
                  "description": "A crispy-edged fried egg for added richness and protein, connecting back to the breakfast inspiration."
                }
              ],
