              ],
              "description": "A classic Creole remoulade made with mayonnaise, Creole mustard, lemon juice, capers, cornichons, garlic, and Cajun spices with a touch of hot sauce. Tangy, complex, and slightly spicy—the signature sauce on the chicken.",
              "ingredients": [
