              "description": "A bold, peppery sauce combining sour cream, mayonnaise, and extra hot prepared horseradish with raw minced garlic, lemon juice, and red wine vinegar. This is the primary sauce—sharp, tangy, and sophisticated.",
              "ingredients": [
                {
                  "item": "sour cream",
                  "amount": "3.5 tbsp"
                },
                {
                  "item": "mayonnaise",
                  "amount": "2 tbsp"
                },
                {
                  "item": "extra hot prepared horseradish",
                  "amount": "2.5 tbsp"
                },
