              ],
              "description": "A refreshing slaw featuring shredded red cabbage and carrots tossed with crumbled feta cheese, fresh baby arugula, pickled red onions, and a lemon-forward dressing with bright citrus zest and a hint of sweetness.",
              "ingredients": [
                {
                  "item": "shredded red cabbage",
                  "amount": "1 cup"
                },
                {
                  "item": "shredded carrots",
                  "amount": "1/4 cup"
                },
