                  "amount": "1/4 tsp"
                },
                {
                  "item": "salt",
                  "amount": "pinch"
                }
              ],
              "directions": [
                "In a small saucepan, combine 1 cup fresh cranberries, 1/2 cup fresh orange juice, 1 tsp orange zest, 2 tbsp brown sugar, and 1 tbsp honey.",
                "Bring to a simmer over medium heat and cook 8-10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until cranberries burst and sauce thickens.",
                "Add 1/4 tsp ground cinnamon, a pinch of ground nutmeg, and 1/4 tsp grated fresh ginger.",
                "Simmer 1 more minute.",
                "Season with a pinch of salt.",
                "Remove from heat and let cool to room temperature."
